    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63615" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσχροι</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ στροφικὰ τῶν
				σπερμάτων</span>
			, i. e. <i>plants which were ploughed into the ground</i>, to
			serve for manure, as lupines in Italy, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
